      "widgets_values": [
        "## Klein removes the person.\n\nThis is the Flux.2 Klein 4B base edit from the person-removal thread. The photo is the reference. The prompt tells Klein to remove the person and rebuild the background. It does not use a mask, so it can also change pixels outside the person.\n\nBase model: 20 steps, CFG 5, euler, simple. If the person is still there, raise steps on KLEIN EDIT. If the whole picture drifts, lower CFG toward 3.\n\nModels: flux-2-klein-base-4b-fp8.safetensors, qwen_3_4b.safetensors with type flux2, flux2-vae.safetensors."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Klein removes the person.\n\nThis is the Flux.2 Klein 4B base edit from the person-removal thread. The photo is the reference. The prompt tells Klein to remove the person and rebuild the background. It does not use a mask, so it can also change pixels outside the person.\n\nBase model: 20 steps, CFG 5, euler, simple. If the person is still there, raise steps on KLEIN EDIT. If the whole picture drifts, lower CFG toward 3.\n\nModels: flux-2-klein-base-4b-fp8.safetensors, qwen_3_4b.safetensors with type flux2, flux2-vae.safetensors."
      }
